gn=center style='text-align:center;line-height:115%'><b><span\r\n  lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n <\/tr>\r\n <tr style='height:16.2pt'>\r\n  <td width=236 valign=top style='width:176.65pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:16.2pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal style='line-height:115%;text-autospace:none'><b><span\r\n  lang=EN-US style='font-size:10.5pt;line-height:115%;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>HLA\r\n  B-27 DNA-RESULT<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n  <td width=157 valign=top style='width:117.75pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:16.2pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal align=center style='text-align:center'><span lang=EN-US\r\n  style='font-size:10.5pt'>NOT DETECTED<\/span><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n  <td width=132 valign=top style='width:99.0pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:16.2pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal align=center style='text-align:center'><span\r\n  style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Calibri\",sans-serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n  <td width=137 valign=top style='width:102.75pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:16.2pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal align=center style='text-align:center;line-height:115%'><span\r\n  lang=EN-US style='font-size:10.5pt;line-height:115%'>NEGATIVE<\/span><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n <\/tr>\r\n <tr style='height:16.2pt'>\r\n  <td width=236 valign=top style='width:176.65pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:16.2pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal style='line-height:115%;text-autospace:none'><span\r\n  lang=EN-US style='font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>Methodology: PCR<\/span><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n  <td width=157 valign=top style='width:117.75pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:16.2pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal style='line-height:115%;text-autospace:none'><span\r\n  style='font-size:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:\"Arial\",sans-serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n  <td width=132 valign=top style='width:99.0pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:16.2pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal style='line-height:115%;text-autospace:none'><span\r\n  style='font-size:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:\"Arial\",sans-serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n  <td width=137 valign=top style='width:102.75pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:16.2pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal style='line-height:115%'><span style='font-family:\"Arial\",sans-serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n <\/tr>\r\n<\/table>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-autospace:none'><b><span style='font-size:9.0pt;\r\nfont-family:\"Arial\",sans-serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-autospace:none'><b><span style='font-size:9.0pt;\r\nfont-family:\"Arial\",sans-serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-autospace:none'><b><span style='font-size:9.0pt;\r\nfont-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>Clinical Background:<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-autospace:none'><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>Human leukocyte antigen B27\r\n(HLA-B27) is a major histocompatibility complex class 1 molecule that is\r\nstrongly associated with the disease ankylosing spondylitis. Testing<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-autospace:none'><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>for HLA B27 is of diagnostic\r\nvalue because 90% of patients with ankylosing spondylitis have the B27 antigen.\r\nThe outcome of this test must always be correlated with<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-autospace:none'><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>history, clinical significance of\r\nthe patient and other pertinent data and should not be used alone for the\r\ninterpretation of result.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-autospace:none'><b><span style='font-size:9.0pt;\r\nfont-family:\"Arial\",sans-serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-autospace:none'><b><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>Please Note:<\/span><\/b><span\r\nstyle='font-family:\"Courier New\"'> <\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-autospace:none'><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>1.The results of this report need\r\nto be interpreted by a qualified medical professional.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-autospace:none'><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>2. Each technology has a\r\nlimitation and hence it is advised to corroborate the results with different <\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-autospace:none'><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 techniques or through repeat\r\nsampling if indications persist<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-autospace:none'><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>3. Same technique\/lab is\r\nadvisable for follow up testing during treatment<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-autospace:none'><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>4. Although all precautions are\r\ntaken during molecular genetic tests, the currently available data indicate \u00a0<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-autospace:none'><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 that the technical e\r\nmolecular DNA analysis is approximately 2%. It is important that all clinicians\r\nor \u00a0<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-autospace:none'><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 persons requesting Molecular\r\nDiagnostic testing are aware of these data before acting upon the results.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-autospace:none'><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>5. The results assume that the\r\nsample is provided from this patient only and that all patient information <\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-autospace:none'><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 provided is correct.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><b><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><b><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><b><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><b><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><b><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><b><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><b><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><b><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span style='position:relative;\r\nz-index:251658240;left:-140px;top:250px;width:1090px;height:252px'><img\r\nwidth=872 height=2 src=\"data:image\/gif;base64,R0lGODlhQgQCAHcAMSH+GlNvZnR3YXJlOiBNaWNyb3NvZnQgT2ZmaWNlACH5BAEAAAAALAAAAABBBAIAgAAAAAAAAAJHBHKJq83vIpyy0msz3rrz74XgKJbkaaboqrbs68bwLN